{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CATCH</strong> is an easy-to-play game that you, your family and friends can pick up at any time for a quick, easy laugh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153800/extras/a93b3df0dca714ebf5b505b2f6030a8b.avif?t=1763977756\" width=930 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the simple game of <strong>CATCH</strong>! Take turns chasing each other, trying to <i>TAG</i> the opposite player. But watch out, you only have <i>30 seconds</i> or the point goes to the defender!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153800/extras/84ac8224ca1bd54f11e3bde414018359.avif?t=1763977756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153800/extras_big/84ac8224ca1bd54f11e3bde414018359.webp?t=1763977756 width=1560 height=968 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 10 colorful and unique maps to run around on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth controls chosen for easier gameplay and a more enjoyable experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups that makes the game more equal as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprisingly entertaining concept.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless playability - randomized maps, powerups and an infinite amount of rounds!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're IT!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4153800?t=1763977756","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153800/93a23e51b7ea2db46c2c39b831fb9f40dc00624a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763977756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153800/23252df2be08c26176e1d0d2c20b83b4695e84db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763977756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153800/23252df2be08c26176e1d0d2c20b83b4695e84db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763977756","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4187990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CATCH</strong> is an easy-to-play game that you, your family and friends can pick up at any time for a quick, easy laugh!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153800/extras/a93b3df0dca714ebf5b505b2f6030a8b.avif?t=1763977756\" width=930 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the simple game of <strong>CATCH</strong>! Take turns chasing each other, trying to <i>TAG</i> the opposite player. But watch out, you only have <i>30 seconds</i> or the point goes to the defender!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153800/extras/84ac8224ca1bd54f11e3bde414018359.avif?t=1763977756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153800/extras_big/84ac8224ca1bd54f11e3bde414018359.webp?t=1763977756 width=1560 height=968 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 10 colorful and unique maps to run around on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth controls chosen for easier gameplay and a more enjoyable experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups that makes the game more equal as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprisingly entertaining concept.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless playability - randomized maps, powerups and an infinite amount of rounds!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're IT!</p>","developers":["Melollo"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153800/80eaf1361ae0e9167923f2a0fdec383009d62f92/header.jpg?t=1763977756","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Melvin Piirimets. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4153800/48226830/959a1002deaeaa9c828051d1e2e5e792098b9705/1763977513/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763977754","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4153800/48226830/959a1002deaeaa9c828051d1e2e5e792098b9705/1763977513/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763977754","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4153800/48226830/959a1002deaeaa9c828051d1e2e5e792098b9705/1763977513/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763977754","id":257236909,"name":"CATCH - Available Now!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257236909/71744ead0d84299a2ae809776c1b434566a08cdc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763977754"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4153800/87016047